  "description": "Dependency injection for the .NET client for Chroma, the vector database: AddChromaClient and AddKeyedChromaClient. Tested with Chroma 0.4.10 to 1.5.9 and with Chroma Cloud.",
  "id": "ChromaDotNet.Client.DependencyInjection",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-04T17:33:33.997Z",
